## Yoneda-inspired ABI law

This is an architectural analogy, not a theorem claim about HFO.

The useful Yoneda-style rule is:

> Characterize an actor/capability by the complete typed interactions it supports at the ABI and the observable receipts those interactions produce, rather than by hidden implementation identity.

Operational consequence:
- provider/model/session identity is replaceable when the required port behavior, invariants, acceptance suite and evidence ceiling are preserved;
- two implementations that are observationally equivalent across the relevant HFO interaction tests may occupy the same phenotype/interface class at that exact claim ceiling;
- hidden chain-of-thought, brand name or internal architecture is not admission evidence;
- a changed observable morphism/port behavior is a genotype/interface change and must re-enter HIVE as appropriate.

Compressed law:

`CAPABILITY_IDENTITY ~= VERIFIED_ABI_INTERACTIONS + INVARIANTS + RECEIPTS`, not `MODEL_NAME`.

## Sparse recursive hyperoctree search illumination

MOME/MAP-Elites is the evolutionary memory. The search space should be represented as a **sparse adaptive hierarchical index**, not a flat leaderboard and not an eagerly materialized combinatorial tree.

Example descriptor dimensions may include:
- domain/task family;
- uncertainty/novelty;
- effect/risk class;
- autonomy band;
- resource/cost/quota band;
- latency/takt band;
- verification burden/correlation class;
- operator-touch/external-fitness band.

A coarse descriptor cell contains a Pareto set. Split a cell into finer child cells only when evidence density, multimodality, conflict or decision value justifies increased resolution. Empty regions remain virtual/unmaterialized.

This is the **recursive hyperoctree** interpretation: hierarchical search-space illumination with local niches and recursive refinement. It is not a requirement to instantiate every theoretical child or spawn a neural agent for every cell.

MOME law:

`MORE_VARIATION_WITHOUT_SELECTION_OR_HEREDITY = WASTE`.

A phenotype becomes a champion only relative to its descriptor cell and evidence ceiling. Ecological champions require external/protected outcomes, not internal LLM preference.

## Stigmergy and the Eldritch Tapestry

HFO coordination is stigmergic when actors alter durable environmental state that later actors sense through the Web:
- READY/RESULT/VERDICT/ConsumerAck receipts;
- WorkCell status;
- STRIFE/SPLENDOR;
- scars/antibodies;
- MOME champion and fitness changes;
- provider capacity/cost changes;
- changed-world observations.

The Eldritch Tapestry is the human-facing semantic compression of this linked evidence/possibility graph. Every accepted or hypothetical thread must still resolve to exact GitHub Web pointers or typed hypotheses.

Pheromones may alter attention, priority and mutation probability among already-eligible choices. They **never** create authority, work, leases, fences, truth, budgets, verdicts, ConsumerAck or effect permission. Signal strength is evidence/reducer bound and decays or expires; a producer cannot make itself important by repeatedly praising its own output.

`STIGMERGY_BIASES_SELECTION__REFERENCE_MONITOR_AUTHORIZES_EFFECT`.

This distinction prevents a popular or repeated signal from becoming an accidental command channel or reward-hacking feedback loop.
